5"}],"short_description":"Dragon Maiden is a 2D pixel-art mystery adventure. As Wang Xie, you\u2019re trapped in a time loop on the day of the Mountain God Ceremony. Relive the 22 hours before midnight, uncover the truth behind the village\u2019s destruction, and break free from the cycle.","steam_appid":3573700,"support_info":{"email":"support@2pgames.net","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese","type":"game","website":null}